1
00:00:00,135 --> 00:00:03,805
(Sheldon:)where even the physicists
are basically engineers."

2
00:00:03,806 --> 00:00:05,876
(gasps)
"Engineers"!

3
00:00:07,576 --> 00:00:10,476
(Sheldon:)Do you know
how insulting that is?

4
00:00:10,479 --> 00:00:12,279
(Sheldon:)Yes.

5
00:00:12,281 --> 00:00:15,151
(Raj:)Guys, this person's
just going out of their way

6
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:17,120
(Raj:)to get a rise out of you.

7
00:00:17,119 --> 00:00:19,319
(Sheldon:)Yeah, but it's
still so aggravating.
Yeah, well,

8
00:00:19,321 --> 00:00:21,291
(Raj:)all the other comments
said really nice things.

9
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:22,920
(Raj:)Focus on those.
Yeah.

10
00:00:22,925 --> 00:00:25,125
(Howard:)Dr. Dmitri Plancovik

11
00:00:25,127 --> 00:00:27,127
(Howard:)of Moscow
University said,

12
00:00:27,129 --> 00:00:29,129
(Russian accent):
"Dis paper great.

13
00:00:29,131 --> 00:00:31,901
(Howard:)I love it more
than 'wodka.'"

14
00:00:33,335 --> 00:00:35,765
(Raj:)See? Better
with the accent.

15
00:00:35,771 --> 00:00:37,141
SHELDON:
And...

16
00:00:37,139 --> 00:00:38,209
(Sheldon:)send.

17
00:00:38,207 --> 00:00:39,807
(Leonard:)What did you write?

18
00:00:39,808 --> 00:00:41,338
(Sheldon:)I'm done hiding from bullies.

19
00:00:41,343 --> 00:00:43,273
(Sheldon:)I'm taking this
into the real world.

20
00:00:43,278 --> 00:00:45,178
(Leonard:)What does that mean?
I told him we'll meet him

21
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:47,210
(Sheldon:)face-to-face anytime, anywhere.

22
00:00:47,216 --> 00:00:49,346
(Leonard:)Are you crazy?
You don't know who
this person is.

23
00:00:49,351 --> 00:00:50,181
Delete that!
Come on, Sheldon!

24
00:00:50,185 --> 00:00:51,315
(Sheldon:)Oh, okay,

25
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,550
(Sheldon:)okay, calm down.

26
00:00:53,555 --> 00:00:55,285
(electronic tones play)

27
00:00:55,290 --> 00:00:57,160
(gasps)
It's him!

